  "description": "In the once peaceful Goat Village, Woo I-ram suddenly became a cursed omen.\n\nShunned and burdened with despair, she made a decision—\nto end it all by seeking out a wolf to devour her.\n\nBut there was just one problem…\n\nThis wolf wasn’t normal.\n\nAs she embarks on a journey toward what she believes to be the perfect death,\nI-ram begins to question everything.\n\nCan she find a reason to live… in the last place she expected?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=806304), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9392462)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003041)",
